                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ab3635e5-294e-3f65-b20f-b15ca46d3091",
                        "entry_id": "cd2e28c6-c182-3457-9ecb-e7798a8f2693",
                        "glosses": [
                            "konieczność wykonania posunięcia w pozycji, w której każdy ruch pogarsza położenie gracza"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6341726f-c59f-4f06-ac50-394bac4bbf7a",
                                "sense_id": "ab3635e5-294e-3f65-b20f-b15ca46d3091",
                                "text": "Michał kiedyś demonstrował mi na szachownicy takie sytuacje, gdy jedna ze stron właściwie nie ma ruchu, bo każde posunięcie ją osłabia albo wręcz grozi katastrofą; nazywał to, zdaje się, zugzwangiem i ja teraz byłem właśnie w takim zugzwangu"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c486c306-826b-46c9-9bb7-742bb85e27f9",
                        "source_entry_id": "cd2e28c6-c182-3457-9ecb-e7798a8f2693",
                        "source_sense_id": "ab3635e5-294e-3f65-b20f-b15ca46d3091",
                        "target_lang_word": "zugzwang",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "zugzwang",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6b20274f-f8c1-312c-97fd-c2508851e250",
                                        "entry_id": "e108afc9-043e-3bfb-8ca4-0c8a617f56a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A situation in which a player is forced to make a disadvantageous move."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b3e4ae1b-fab7-3817-905a-b5b2a806ff6f",
                                        "entry_id": "e108afc9-043e-3bfb-8ca4-0c8a617f56a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A situation in which someone is forced to make a disadvantageous move."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc3e39f9-4671-4131-88b6-f8ba0326a6ae",
                                                "sense_id": "b3e4ae1b-fab7-3817-905a-b5b2a806ff6f",
                                                "text": "An explanation for this phenomenon may be that speech acts that include instructions (e.g., a command or request) show a higher level of activity than speech acts of assertion; the ethnomethodological analysis of conversation speaks of conversational Zugzwänge:²⁴ a request, a question or a command demands a reaction of the addressee."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5714666-62ba-4aa6-92c7-72ea264ba640",
                                                "sense_id": "b3e4ae1b-fab7-3817-905a-b5b2a806ff6f",
                                                "text": "Here, too, it is Russia that, ironically, is in Zugzwang. Because the central rationale of Moscow's occupation of Crimea was the defense of supposedly threatened Russians, Putin and his minions must continue insisting that Ukraine's Russians are under threat and that their right are being systematically violated."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8cdf385c-12b0-4bbe-866e-dc9fcc66446b",
                                                "sense_id": "b3e4ae1b-fab7-3817-905a-b5b2a806ff6f",
                                                "text": "not only is there a lack of good alternatives concerning some particular policy decisions, but the whole Russian system is moving towards a zugzwang."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e4ed79a-aa05-45da-a75b-804f78a1907a",
                                                "sense_id": "b3e4ae1b-fab7-3817-905a-b5b2a806ff6f",
                                                "text": "\"In chess terms, Putin is not in a stalemate, he's in a zugzwang: He is forced to make further moves even if they worsen his position, precisely because he must keep selling his 'war of civilizations' concept to Russians,\" Leonid Bershidsky, the self-exiled Russian political analyst wrote in Bloomberg recently."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46ea1156-dc22-40ff-8d17-5b5aa530b57f",
                                                "sense_id": "b3e4ae1b-fab7-3817-905a-b5b2a806ff6f",
                                                "text": "Perhaps the Soviet Union under Gromyko could have persuaded him against attacking Kuwait, which as we know, unleashed irreversible consequences in the Middle East and the world as a whole, opening the door to U.S. interventions around the world. But the question of whether Gromyko would have been more open to dialogue with the West and China remains unanswerable. Would he have launched a new round of détente in international relations (without, of course, giving up the whole game as Gorbachev did) or would he have maintained the Zugzwang in Soviet-U.S. affairs that Reagan and Andropov had established?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d11b0449-443a-4522-9756-0121193d5bfc",
                                                "sense_id": "b3e4ae1b-fab7-3817-905a-b5b2a806ff6f",
                                                "text": "the Soviet concessions at Madrid did not prove enough to prevent the stationing of US Euromissiles as part of NATO’s dual-track decision, and Moscow found itself in economic and political Zugzwang at the end of the Andropov era, as Vladislav Zubok has pointed out."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24031e78-98da-4df1-a126-1839d808e8be",
                                                "sense_id": "b3e4ae1b-fab7-3817-905a-b5b2a806ff6f",
                                                "text": "The empirical domain has illustrated Kazakhstan’s carefully calibrated hedging position amid the two regional Leviathans engaged in leverage seeking. The current paradigm insinuates that to respond to China’s rise, Russia is compelled to increase its engagement with Kazakhstan by maintaining its hierarchical grip over Nur-Sultan, while offering sufficient security provision (CSTO and, partly, SCO) and means for economic development (EAEU) to ensure that it remains in the Kremlin-centric political order. Nevertheless, Russia has not yet entirely released itself from the zugzwang situation, as it has to further resort to reactionary acts to restrain a rising China, despite the fact that any move possible would further constrain Russia geopolitically stemming from Beijing’s increasing power projection, chiefly in the economic domain (SREB)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2a4ae8b3-e3fb-4bc2-b83b-3de2fb40a880",
                        "source_entry_id": "cd2e28c6-c182-3457-9ecb-e7798a8f2693",
                        "source_sense_id": "ab3635e5-294e-3f65-b20f-b15ca46d3091",
                        "target_lang_word": "Zugzwang",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Zugzwang",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6b72049a-ac0a-36f3-b8db-0b6c3e67e03d",
                                        "entry_id": "8291b3d8-273c-3fcc-afa9-7b885554d981",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Zwang, einen Zug ausführen zu müssen, wenn sich dieser negativ auf das eigene Spiel auswirken wird"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "bei Spielen mit Zugpflicht, insbesondere beim",
                                            "Schach"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c82dc50e-aadd-4eda-86d4-e535a9a238ed",
                                                "sense_id": "6b72049a-ac0a-36f3-b8db-0b6c3e67e03d",
                                                "text": "Das Spiel war lange Zeit ausgeglichen, aber schlussendlich verlor er wegen Zugzwang."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2b4e5ad-8b47-41fd-8876-9035ef7e369a",
                                                "sense_id": "6b72049a-ac0a-36f3-b8db-0b6c3e67e03d",
                                                "text": "„Einmal mehr ist Schwarz in Zugzwang, weil seine Figuren die Damenflügelbauern verteidigen müssen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "21ef6f9c-ed36-393e-b2bc-66414c5f6551",
                                        "entry_id": "8291b3d8-273c-3fcc-afa9-7b885554d981",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "der Zwang, etwas zu tun zu müssen, eine Entscheidung zu fällen; diese Handlung muss aber nicht zwangsläufig benachteiligende Folgen haben"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "general"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "157fe8d9-2287-4ad2-9424-dd983dc3715b",
                                                "sense_id": "21ef6f9c-ed36-393e-b2bc-66414c5f6551",
                                                "text": "Die Partei XY gerät nun in Zugzwang."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bca8ecaf-32c3-4437-84aa-ffa9694016b2",
                        "source_entry_id": "cd2e28c6-c182-3457-9ecb-e7798a8f2693",
                        "source_sense_id": "ab3635e5-294e-3f65-b20f-b15ca46d3091",
                        "target_lang_word": "цугцва́нг",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "цугцва́нг",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9cd9d26f-e742-38f9-8340-ad36b702c62b",
                                        "entry_id": "dff0eba4-0479-388b-a5c4-7abe55c2e134",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "шахм. положение в игре, при котором одна из сторон оказывается вынужденной сделать невыгодный для неё (проигрывающий) очередной ход"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7709cb5-6a3b-42bf-b92b-e5bf11e7808e",
                                                "sense_id": "9cd9d26f-e742-38f9-8340-ad36b702c62b",
                                                "text": "К 63-му ходу материальный перевес был на стороне Крамника, но как воспользоваться цугцвангом белых фигур Каспарова, Владимир так и не нашёл."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a5345a7-242e-4f8b-a855-9068975f9295",
                                                "sense_id": "9cd9d26f-e742-38f9-8340-ad36b702c62b",
                                                "text": "Не отрывая взгляд от доски, он отхлебнул из кружки мадеры и передвинул коня на С2; чёрные оказались в цугцванге."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65168c44-2407-4310-b091-46fd8ce98cca",
                                                "sense_id": "9cd9d26f-e742-38f9-8340-ad36b702c62b",
                                                "text": "38. R: a7. На доске почти полный цугцванг. Израсходовав почти все оставшиеся секунды, Топалов не нашёл спасения."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4261a8ef-f683-330d-a094-f21338024d05",
                                        "entry_id": "dff0eba4-0479-388b-a5c4-7abe55c2e134",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "перен., книжн. ситуация, при которой любое действие ведёт к ухудшению положения"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a89499b5-7bc5-4f2d-a858-bbe42e9b628e",
                                                "sense_id": "4261a8ef-f683-330d-a094-f21338024d05",
                                                "text": "Первичная ошибка заключается в тайном нарушении правил общественной морали: «не возжелай жену ближнего своего» и «не прелюбодействуй». Нарушенная конвенция могла быть совершенно иной — достаточно было солгать в мелочи, совершить иной проступок. Персонаж всё равно попадает в ситуацию цугцванга."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "495640cb-236f-44ff-a521-43342c973e65",
                                                "sense_id": "4261a8ef-f683-330d-a094-f21338024d05",
                                                "text": "Выход из инвестиционного цугцванга и экономической стагнации возможен только в случае серьёзного шока ― позитивного или негативного."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
